    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Respiratory disorders impose a major health burden globally and are a major cause of morbidity and mortality in Pakistan. This simulation course provided experiential learning for general practitioners to brush up on their skills in the assessment, diagnosis and management of common respiratory disorders, and to help them distinguish between everyday symptoms and those that warrant further investigation.",
